- the Routledge product page lists chapter titles only, and its 'Preview Book' button yields no text;
- Crossref holds 14 chapter DOIs (10.1201/9781003710196-1 to -14) with no abstracts and no license;
- the Taylor & Francis page returned HTTP 503 to curl and no content to WebFetch;
- the Google Books API answered HTTP 429.
No workaround was attempted. Whether the book states the identification is unknown. It predates the program's notebook (September 2026), so a statement there would be one more prior restatement, not a priority earlier than Minic 2020. Its likely chapters are 11 ('cGħ, or, Quantum Gravity, so far') and 12 ('Coda: What is Quantum Theory of Gravity?').
